b2e","original_label":"Bovine serum albumin","preparation":"Mix components except yeast extract, bovine serum albumin and Na2S x 9H2O. Bring to a boil for 5-10 sec and flush with N2. Adjust pH to 7.6 at 80-90C. After cooling to room temperature, dispense the medium into serum bottles under a N2 atmosphere, seal with butyl rubber stoppers and autoclave. Separately autoclave yeast extract as a 10% solution and neutralized Na2S x 9H2O as a 5% solution under a N2 atmosphere. Filter-sterilize bovine serum albumin as a 10% (w/v) solution under a N2 atmosphere. Before inoculation, aseptically and anaerobically add the yeast extract, bovine serum albumin and neutralized Na2S x 9H2O solutions.","product_id":null,"quantity":{"unit":"G_PER_L","value":"1"},"review_status":"SUPPORTED","source_id":"CultureMech:013001","source_kind":"recipe","source_occurrence_key":"ingredient:bovine-serum-albumin","source_payload":{"components":[{"concentration":{"unit":"G_PER_L","value":"1"},"preferred_term":"Bovine serum albumin","term":{"id":"mediadive.compound:705","label":"Bovine serum albumin"}}],"name":{},"path":"/Users/marcin/Documents/VIMSS/ontology/Mechs/CultureMech/data/normalized_yaml/bacterial/mediadive_3938_Main_sol_J252.yaml","preparation_notes":"Mix components except yeast extract, bovine serum albumin and Na2S x 9H2O. Bring to a boil for 5-10 sec and flush with N2. Adjust pH to 7.6 at 80-90C. After cooling to room temperature, dispense the medium into serum bottles under a N2 atmosphere, seal with butyl rubber stoppers and autoclave. Separately autoclave yeast extract as a 10% solution and neutralized Na2S x 9H2O as a 5% solution under a N2 atmosphere. Filter-sterilize bovine serum albumin as a 10% (w/v) solution under a N2 atmosphere. Before inoculation, aseptically and anaerobically add the yeast extract, bovine serum albumin and neutralized Na2S x 9H2O solutions.","recipe_id":"CultureMech:013001","sha256":"d2dfe34f08e94ba54a5dc102a11c4e25eba51978c256b62567ddbcc0edd642eb"}},{"a